      "main": "<div class=\"page-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">PROJECT MAP</div><h1>从原项目继续工作</h1><p>六类任务承载不同用途；外部协作可承接其中的一段工作。</p></div><div class=\"head-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#case\" data-testid=\"open-case\">查看关联 Case ↗</a></div></div><section class=\"project-banner\"><span class=\"pill\">云杉零售 · 全部为合成资料</span><h2>四店会员资料核查</h2><p>先厘清口径与差异，再决定修订。原任务、报告、验收和后续反馈留在 OptraCall。</p><div class=\"head-actions\"><a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"#task/analysis\" data-testid=\"open-analysis\">继续分析任务 →</a><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#report\">查看当前报告</a></div></section><div class=\"row between\" style=\"margin-bottom:13px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px\">项目任务 <span class=\"muted small\">6</span></h2><span class=\"small muted\">需求 → 分析 → 计划 → 决策 → 执行 → 反馈</span></div><section class=\"six-grid\" aria-label=\"六类任务\"><a class=\"task-tile \" href=\"#task/requirement\" data-testid=\"task-requirement\"><div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">R / 需求</span><span class=\"pill gray\">已完成</span></div><strong>明确会员资料核查范围</strong><p>可按目标外派片段：整理四店资料字段与缺失项</p><div class=\"foot\"><span>保留在原需求任务</span><span>打开 →</span></div></a><a class=\"task-tile feature\" href=\"#task/analysis\" data-testid=\"task-analysis\"><div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">A / 分析</span><span class=\"pill green\">进行中</span></div><strong>四店会员资料一致性核查</strong><p>可按目标外派片段：核查四店会员字段映射与重复记录</p><div class=\"foot\"><span>保留在原分析任务</span><span>打开 →</span></div></a><a class=\"task-tile \" href=\"#task/plan\" data-testid=\"task-plan\"><div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">P / 计划</span><span class=\"pill gray\">草稿</span></div><strong>安排资料修订与复查计划</strong><p>可按目标外派片段：编写资料修订排期与复查清单</p><div class=\"foot\"><span>保留在原计划任务</span><span>打开 →</span></div></a><a class=\"task-tile \" href=\"#task/decision\" data-testid=\"task-decision\"><div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">D / 决策</span><span class=\"pill gray\">待资料</span></div><strong>核定四店会员口径处理方案</strong><p>可按目标外派片段：整理可选方案、证据与影响对照</p><div class=\"foot\"><span>保留在原决策任务</span><span>打开 →</span></div></a><a class=\"task-tile \" href=\"#task/do\" data-testid=\"task-do\"><div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Do / 执行</span><span class=\"pill gray\">未开始</span></div><strong>落实获准的资料修订</strong><p>可按目标外派片段：在隔离副本准备修订脚本与差异</p><div class=\"foot\"><span>保留在原执行任务</span><span>打开 →</span></div></a><a class=\"task-tile \" href=\"#task/teach\" data-testid=\"task-teach\"><div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">T / 反馈</span><span class=\"pill gray\">未开始</span></div><strong>复盘核查结果与业务反馈</strong><p>可按目标外派片段：汇总四店反馈与未解决问题</p><div class=\"foot\"><span>保留在原反馈任务</span><span>打开 →</span></div></a></section><div class=\"callout section-space\">这是已有项目的六个示例任务。打开任务、Case、报告或资产依据，只切换阅读位置；不会派单或创建新任务。</div>",
