      "main": "<div class=\"page-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">EXTERNAL COLLABORATION</div><h1>在原任务中按需外派</h1><p>外派是执行方式；任务用途和闭环仍由原 Task 承载。</p></div><div class=\"head-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#task/analysis\">← 原任务</a></div></div><div class=\"context-strip\"><span>项目：云杉零售四店会员资料核查</span><span>任务：分析 · 四店会员资料一致性核查</span><span>Case：会员资料治理</span><span>任务数：6（浏览不会新建）</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><section class=\"card\"><div class=\"pad\"><h2>把适合外部能力的片段交出去</h2><p class=\"lead muted\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">核查四店会员字段映射与重复记录</p><div class=\"callout section-space\">Agent 会准备、发布、跟进并验收。你只需一次确认业务目标与必要权限；逐条读取、评论和回执由 Agent 在范围内处理。</div><div style=\"margin-top:20px\"><button class=\"btn primary\" data-action=\"authorize\" data-testid=\"authorize-open\">查看外派建议与授权</button></div></div></section><aside><section class=\"card collab\"><div class=\"card-head\"><h2>⇄ 外部协作</h2><span class=\"pill gray\">待授权</span></div><div class=\"pad\"><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Agent 的建议</div><h3>核查四店会员字段映射与重复记录</h3><p>这段核查可交给外部执行者完成；我会准备工单、跟进进度，并核验回传。业务判断仍回到本任务。</p><div class=\"tiny-line\"></div><p><strong style=\"color:#59416f\">只需确认一次必要授权</strong><br>目标、外派范围、执行者与资产权限一起确认，范围内无需逐条审批读取。</p><button class=\"btn primary\" data-action=\"authorize\" data-testid=\"authorize-open\">查看建议并授权 →</button></div></section></aside></div>",
